&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We offer a benefit of a hybrid working arrangement, with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Wednesday and Thursday as office-based days and the remaining working days remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;. The successful individual will be expected to attend the London office and shoot locations to support filming, meetings and collaboration with the wider Content and Social teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be expected to&amp;nbsp;have&amp;nbsp;your own filming and camera&amp;nbsp;equipment, although Rightmove can support with arranging suitable filming locations where needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with our Content team, with additional creative input and oversight from our Social team, participating in regular check-ins and content reviews throughout the project.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Contract Engagement &amp;amp; Payment Arrangements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:299,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:299}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To engage with Rightmove on this contract, the successful candidate will be required to work through one of Rightmove&#39;s &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;pre-vetted umbrella companies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, which will be responsible for processing payments and payroll administration for the duration of the engagement. Please note the benefits below are only applicable to our directly engaged employees. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The successful candidate will be required to complete the relevant registration and onboarding process with one of our approved umbrella providers before commencing the engagement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please provide a link to your showreel&amp;nbsp;and/or portfolio in your application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Rightmove&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Despite our growth, we’ve remained a friendly, supportive place to work, with employee #1 still working here!&amp;nbsp; We’ve done this by placing the Rightmove Hows at the heart of everything we do. These are the essential values that reflect our culture, and include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;create&amp;nbsp;value…&lt;/strong&gt;by delivering results and building trust with partners and consumers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;think&amp;nbsp;bigger…&lt;/strong&gt;by acting with curiosity and setting bold aspirations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;care&amp;nbsp;deeply…&lt;/strong&gt;by being real, having fun, and valuing diversity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;move&amp;nbsp;together…&lt;/strong&gt;by being one team - internally collaborative, externally competitive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;make&amp;nbsp;a difference…&lt;/strong&gt;by focusing on delivering measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/culture/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;float: left; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Job-alerts-1.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;452&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in careers that open doors and help our team develop by providing an open and inclusive work environment, offering ongoing&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;training opportunities, and supporting charity fundraising events. And with &lt;strong&gt;89% of Rightmovers saying we’re a great place to work&lt;/strong&gt;, we’re clearly doing something right!&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/07/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-1-2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cash plan for dental, optical and physio treatments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance, Pension and Life Insurance, Employee Assistance Plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27 days holiday plus two (paid) volunteering days a year to give back, and holiday buy schemes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributory stakeholder pension.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance at 4x your basic salary to a spouse, family member or other nominated person in your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid leave for maternity, paternity, adoption &amp;amp; fertility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel Loans, Bike to Work scheme, Rental Deposit Loan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Charitable contributions through Payroll Giving and donation matching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access deals and discounts on things like travel, electronics, fashion, gym memberships, cinema discounts and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer hybrid working with a minimum of 2 days in the office. For our roles, such as Field or Home-based positions, different working arrangements apply - full details will be shared during the recruitment process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 180);&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-8.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;As an Equal Opportunity Employer, Rightmove will never discriminate based on age, disability, sex, race, religion or belief, gender reassignment, marriage / civil partnership, pregnancy/maternity or sexual orientation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Rightmove, we believe that a diverse and inclusive workforce leads to better innovation, productivity, and overall success. We are committed to creating a welcoming and inclusive environment for all employees, regardless of their background or identity, to develop and promote a diverse culture that reflects the communities we serve.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;By applying, you confirm that you are aged at least 18 or over and&amp;nbsp;that you’ve read and understood our &lt;a class=&quot;decorated-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/c/privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;259&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;193&quot; data-end=&quot;211&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, which explains how we handle and protect your personal information during the recruitment process.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Affirm, we exist for the moments that matter—giving people a clear, predictable way to pay over time, with no hidden fees, no surprises, and no tradeoffs on what matters most.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Product team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Product team listens to our customers’ needs and translates those insights into a clear product vision. The team works closely with design, engineering, and analytics to build scalable financial products that empower people to manage their money with confidence. We rely on empathy, curiosity, and business sense to prioritize features and improve experiences. Our role is to lead with clarity, support cross-functional execution, and champion the user in every decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Product Designer to join us in supporting our post-purchase experience and international expansion. Design serves a vital role at Affirm: from building narratives through data to creating products that help people make important financial decisions. As a designer, you are responsible for crafting experiences that build trust, confidence and deliver on our principles of honest, transparent financial products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re at a critical inflection point in Affirm’s journey, with millions of people engaging with our products and new opportunities to expand how they use Affirm every day. We’re also growing globally, reaching new customers in new geographies every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This Product Designer will help shape our post-purchase experiences, as well as building the next new geographies that Affirm will expand into. You can demonstrate a breadth of design experience leveraging your ability to create delightful experiences that simplify our customers’ payment management experience through Affirm as well as contributing to our wider international expansion strategy. You’ll partner well with design leadership, design research, and content design. You’ll work end-to-end, from contributing towards Design and Product vision to delivering class leading design. You are able to work closely with Product and Engineering to tailor unique customer experiences for our merchants &amp;amp; consumers while ensuring cohesion to the core Affirm experience - championing our customers needs no matter where their journey starts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead end-to-end design for key initiatives within our UK and international experiences, as well as our post purchase experiences globally, across App and Web. You’ll be driving from discovery through to delivery and iteration—achieving meaningful customer and business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own complex flows and ambiguous problem spaces, defining clear problem statements, success metrics, and design direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner closely with product, engineering, and data to make informed trade-offs and deliver intuitive, high-quality experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Balance speed and quality, making pragmatic decisions while contributing to a cohesive product experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use research, data, and experimentation to inform decisions and continuously improve outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute to design systems and patterns, strengthening consistency and scalability across your area.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Facilitate alignment and decision-making, ensuring teams move forward with clarity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support and mentor other designers, helping raise the quality of work across the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong Craft &amp;amp; Execution: You consistently deliver polished, thoughtful interaction and visual design with high attention to detail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product Thinking: You balance user needs, business goals, and technical constraints to make sound design decisions and improve end-to-end experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ownership &amp;amp; Initiative: You take ownership of ambiguous problems and drive work forward with minimal oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cross-functional Collaboration: You build strong partnerships, communicate clearly, and help teams align on decisions and trade-offs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data-Informed Decision Making: You use research, experimentation, and analytics to guide your work and iterate toward better outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team-Level Influence: You’re a trusted design partner within your area, contributing to direction and improving how the team works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Adaptability: You seek feedback, continuously improve your craft, and leverage modern tools—including AI—to accelerate your workflow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tools &amp;amp; Experience: Proficiency with modern design and collaboration tools (Figma, G Suite, Notion, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5+ years of product design experience or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working Here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll design financial products that genuinely help people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work on high-impact experiences used by millions of customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a team that values craft, collaboration, and thoughtful iteration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll have the opportunity to grow your scope, influence, and leadership over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a remote-first position based in the UK with the option to work from our London office for candidates who prefer an office environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base Pay Grade: L&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Equity Grade: UK 5&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employees new to Affirm typically come in at the start of the pay range. Affirm focuses on providing a simple and transparent pay structure based on a variety of factors, including location, experience, and job-related skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base pay is part of a total compensation package that may include monthly stipends for health, wellness, and tech spending, and benefits including 100% subsidized medical coverage, dental, and vision for you and your dependents. In addition, employees may be eligible for equity rewards offered by Affirm Holdings, Inc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GBR base pay range per year&lt;strong&gt;: £&lt;span data-formula-id=&quot;_c_f_4zYZFddFQ5_0&quot; data-error=&quot;false&quot; data-placeholder=&quot;false&quot; data-loading=&quot;false&quot; data-recalculating=&quot;false&quot; data-inactive=&quot;false&quot;&gt;101,000&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-formula-id=&quot;_c_f_4zYZFddFQ5_1&quot; data-error=&quot;false&quot; data-placeholder=&quot;false&quot; data-loading=&quot;false&quot; data-recalculating=&quot;false&quot; data-inactive=&quot;false&quot;&gt;149,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Remote UK&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote-first with flexibility built in&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Affirm is proud to be a remote-first company. Most roles can be done from almost anywhere within the country of employment. Some positions may occasionally require in-person work at an Affirm office, and a few are office-based due to the nature of the work. All new hires will be invited to attend an in-person onboarding experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits designed for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Our benefits reflect our commitment to care, transparency, and flexibility. Here are a few highlights:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage at no cost: We cover 100% of premiums for employees and their dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spending stipends: Monthly stipends support your tech setup, and the ability to choose health and wellness options that are right for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off to recharge: Flexible time off and generous holiday calendars help you rest when you need to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a piece of what you build: Our employee stock purchase plan (ESPP) lets you buy Affirm stock at a discount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to providing an inclusive interview process, including accommodations for candidates with disabilities. If you need support, we’re happy to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For positions based in San Francisco or Los Angeles: Affirm considers qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records, as required by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By clicking &quot;Submit Application,&quot; you acknowledge that you have read Affirm&#39;s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.affirm.com/global-candidate-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Global Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; and consent to the use of your personal information as described.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;description content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Solution architect for Enterprise Modernization in Europe is a senior subject matter expert responsible for technical excellence, solution integrity, and capability development within the service line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This hands-on role leads high-impact client engagements, contributes to pre-sales and solution design, and ensures the regional adoption and evolution of service-specific delivery frameworks, tools, and best practices. The role brings deep expertise in modernization strategies and execution in large legacy systems modernization programs, serving as a trusted technical advisor to both clients and internal teams. This role is key to ensuring delivery quality, enabling service adoption, and evolving the technical maturity of the offering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-responsibilities&quot;&gt;Job responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-responsibilities content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides technical guidance on Enterprise Systems Modernization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports delivery teams in solving complex client problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributes to solution design, proposals, and pre-sales activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develops and refines service accelerators and reference architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentors engineers and architects within the service domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acts as a bridge between delivery teams and global service development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measures success by technical quality, asset adoption, and talent uplift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Requires 10+ years of experience in software engineering or technical consulting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Requires 3+ years in Enterprise Systems Modernization advisory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focuses on technical depth in modernization strategies and enterprise solution architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-qualifications&quot;&gt;Job qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-qualifications content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;technical-skills&quot;&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;qualifications inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting solution design and technical delivery in complex enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build, extend, and support delivery tools, frameworks, and reusable assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical expertise in modernization strategies, cloud architecture, and platform thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong engineering skills, architecture patterns knowledge, and toolchain understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication to translate technical insights into actionable business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative with mentorship abilities and solution-oriented with asset contribution commitment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;professional-skills&quot;&gt;Professional Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;
&lt;div class=&quot;skills inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in software engineering, platform delivery, or technical consulting roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in a subject matter expert or senior technical advisory role within Enterprise Systems Modernization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certifications in relevant platforms, tools, or frameworks for the Enterprise Systems Modernization domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to internal accelerators, open-source projects, or client-aligned IP development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with enterprise transformation programs and the consulting delivery lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
