&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1dfch1y&quot; data-start=&quot;233&quot; data-end=&quot;249&quot;&gt;About the job&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;251&quot; data-end=&quot;320&quot;&gt;Shape how advanced AI hardware is tested before it reaches customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;322&quot; data-end=&quot;556&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll lead the technical direction of manufacturing test solutions for Host Processor Modules, Server Blades, and multi-node rack systems. Your work will help ensure every system meets the highest quality standards before deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;558&quot; data-end=&quot;817&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll own the architecture of the test executive software and develop manufacturing test content that validates complex hardware at scale. Working across hardware, firmware, and software teams, you&#39;ll enable reliable, efficient testing throughout production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;819&quot; data-end=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;This role offers broad technical influence. You&#39;ll solve complex engineering challenges, improve manufacturing quality through data, and help shape the future of Graphcore&#39;s production test capability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1pc0zxi&quot; data-start=&quot;1022&quot; data-end=&quot;1045&quot;&gt;The team and culture&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1047&quot; data-end=&quot;1239&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll join the Product Test and Diagnosis team within Manufacturing Operations. The team defines and delivers test strategies across silicon, boards, server systems, and rack-scale platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1241&quot; data-end=&quot;1439&quot;&gt;Day to day, you&#39;ll work closely with engineers across hardware, firmware, software, manufacturing, and quality. Decisions are driven by technical evidence, collaboration, and continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1441&quot; data-end=&quot;1589&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll have the freedom to lead technically, mentor other engineers, and influence how manufacturing test evolves across globally distributed teams.&lt;/p&gt;
